<title>UGANDA: SOCCER-CAMEROON'S RACING BAFOUSSAM DISQUALIFIED.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-CAMEROON'S RACING BAFOUSSAM DISQUALIFIED.</headline>
<dateline>KAMPALA 1997-04-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Racing Bafoussam of Cameroon were disqualified from the African Cup Winners' Cup after arriving a day late for their match against Uganda's Umeme FC, Ugandan officials said on Thursday.</p>
<p>They said the Confederation of African Football said Umeme would advance to the second round after Racing Bafoussam missed the kick-off for the first leg match in Kampala last month.</p>
</text>
